# Local-only engineering notes — private by default, published one file at
# a time as a deliberate exception (same default-deny shape as auth in
# settings.py: deny, then an explicit, visible opt-out per file). See
# notes/INDEX.md for what's published and why.
notes/*
!notes/INDEX.md
!notes/LOGIN_SECURITY_HARDENING_2026-09-08.md
!notes/RBAC_STAFF_WRITE_GATE_2026-09-09.md
!notes/AUDIT_LOG_2026-09-09.md
!notes/CSP_2026-09-09.md
!notes/DEPENDENCY_LOCK_2026-09-09.md
!notes/DECLINED_2026-09-09.md

